eparation\\text{-}t2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4SeparationT2}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to \\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}separation\\text{-}t2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4SeparationT2}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to \\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the Hausdorff (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span>) separation axiom for a typed topological space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,x,y,U,V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4SeparationT2}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}separation\